{"id":"95cd5e4d0506772c","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-assignment.md","title":"一阶支撑语言的赋值","display":"df-assignment — 一阶支撑语言的赋值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-assignment","aliases":["18-df-assignment"],"display":"df-assignment — 一阶支撑语言的赋值","depends_on":["[[18-df-variable]]","[[18-df-structure]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"4.2.5–4.2.7","source_printed_pages":"48–49","source_pdf_pages":"58–59","source_correspondence":"supplementary-first-order-interface","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-assignment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-assignment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-assignment — 一阶支撑语言的赋值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adee8e90809320b8\" href=\"?note=adee8e90809320b8\" title=\"18-df-variable\">18-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ac3a6265513490d\" href=\"?note=9ac3a6265513490d\" title=\"18-df-structure\">18-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.2.5–4.2.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"48–49"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"58–59"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"supplementary-first-order-interface"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ac3a6265513490d\" href=\"?note=9ac3a6265513490d\" title=\"18-df-structure\">18-df-structure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adee8e90809320b8\" href=\"?note=adee8e90809320b8\" title=\"18-df-variable\">18-df-variable</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 为候选集合函数；更新式仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span> 使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq A^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq A^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[a/x]\\coloneqq\n(\\beta\\restriction(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[a/x]\\coloneqq\n(\\beta\\restriction(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\beta[a/x]\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A),\\qquad\n\\beta[a/x](y)=\n\\begin{cases}a&amp;y=x,\\\\\\beta(y)&amp;y\\ne x.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\beta[a/x]\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A),\\qquad\n\\beta[a/x](y)=\n\\begin{cases}a&amp;y=x,\\\\\\beta(y)&amp;y\\ne x.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给出实际更新函数图。原书的赋值还有每种元数的自由关系变量分量；此处只是一阶对象变量分量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"adee8e90809320b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"9ac3a6265513490d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"9ac3a6265513490d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 见 [[18-df-structure]]，$\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 见 [[18-df-variable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"adee8e90809320b8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 见 [[18-df-structure]]，$\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 见 [[18-df-variable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq A^{\\mathrm{Var}_S}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta[a/x]\\coloneqq\n(\\beta\\restriction(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\setminus\\{x\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle x,a\\rangle\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\beta[a/x]\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A),\\qquad\n\\beta[a/x](y)=\n\\begin{cases}a&y=x,\\\\\\beta(y)&y\\ne x.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1397,"backlinks":[{"id":"635d9c2a8b21701e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M$ 为任意集合。$M\\ne\\varnothing$ 时，$\\mathfrak M_M$ 是下式的集合结构，满足关系与赋值更新取 [[18-df-satisfaction]]、[[18-df-assignment]]；$\\beta\\in M^W$ 是全部变量上的赋值。每个公式仅有有限多个自由变量，因此该赋值表达有限参数，不引入无限参数公式。空集情形由单独分支给出，不调用不存在赋值的空结构满足关系。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-assignment]]"},{"id":"23419e8036fb68bd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$、$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 见 [[18-df-structure]]，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$ 见 [[18-df-assignment]]。"},{"id":"01ff954c42fa05a6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$、$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 见 [[18-df-structure]]；$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$ 见 [[18-df-assignment]]。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"赋值见 [[../18-df-assignment]]，须绑定载体"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-assignment]]"}],"outgoing":["adee8e90809320b8","9ac3a6265513490d"]}